{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":30.719999313354492,"text":"A small faean's figure, a few centimeters tall, holding a snake in each hand, and wearing a long flounced dress. It was found in a sealed pit at Knossos with other sacred objects. Nobody knows whether she is a goddess, a priestess, or something else. Archaeologists gave her the name. The snakes are not a threat. In many ancient cultures, they stand for the home, the earth, and renewal, because they shed their skin.","words":[{"word":"A","start":0,"end":0.47999998927116394},{"word":"small","start":0.47999998927116394,"end":1.0800000429153442},{"word":"faean's","start":1.0800000429153442,"end":1.7000000476837158},{"word":"figure","start":1.7000000476837158,"end":1.9800000190734863},{"word":"a","start":2.440000057220459,"end":2.5},{"word":"few","start":2.5,"end":2.7799999713897705},{"word":"centimeters","start":2.7799999713897705,"end":3.319999933242798},{"word":"tall","start":3.319999933242798,"end":3.8399999141693115},{"word":"holding","start":4.380000114440918,"end":4.579999923706055},{"word":"a","start":4.579999923706055,"end":5.179999828338623},{"word":"snake","start":5.179999828338623,"end":5.179999828338623},{"word":"in","start":5.179999828338623,"end":5.380000114440918},{"word":"each","start":5.380000114440918,"end":5.760000228881836},{"word":"hand","start":5.760000228881836,"end":6.139999866485596},{"word":"and","start":6.460000038146973,"end":6.960000038146973},{"word":"wearing","start":6.960000038146973,"end":6.960000038146973},{"word":"a","start":6.960000038146973,"end":7.300000190734863},{"word":"long","start":7.300000190734863,"end":7.820000171661377},{"word":"flounced","start":7.820000171661377,"end":8.300000190734863},{"word":"dress","start":8.300000190734863,"end":8.760000228881836},{"word":"It","start":9.579999923706055,"end":9.699999809265137},{"word":"was","start":9.699999809265137,"end":9.960000038146973},{"word":"found","start":9.960000038146973,"end":10.15999984741211